<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Medan, Indonesia — Pros & Cons</title>

<style>
    :root {
        --ink: #241a12;
        --paper: #f4ede1;
        --gold: #b8863b;
        --gold-dark: #8a6329;
        --teal: #2f5d55;
        --teal-dark: #1e3d37;
        --line: rgba(36, 26, 18, 0.15);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    }

    header {
        background-color: var(--teal-dark);
        color: var(--paper);
        text-align: center;
        padding: 40px 20px 32px;
    }

    header .eyebrow {
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: var(--gold);
        margin: 0 0 10px;
    }

    header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
        font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 48px);
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    header p {
        margin: 10px 0 0;
        font-size: 15px;
        opacity: 0.8;
    }

    main {
        max-width: 960px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 40px 20px 20px;
    }

    .intro {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto 32px;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #4a3d2e;
    }

    .columns-container {
        display: flex;
        gap: 24px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .card {
        flex: 1 1 300px;
        background: #fffaf1;
        border-radius: 6px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--line);
        padding: 24px 26px 28px;
    }

    .card h3 {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        margin: 0 0 18px;
        font-size: 13px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding-bottom: 12px;
        border-bottom: 2px solid currentColor;
    }

    .pros h3 { color: var(--teal); }
    .cons h3 { color: var(--gold-dark); }

    .card h3::before {
        content: '';
        width: 10px;
        height: 10px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: currentColor;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    ul {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
    }

    li {
        padding: 10px 0;
        line-height: 1.5;
        border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line);
        font-size: 15px;
    }

    li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

    .pros li::before {
        content: '+ ';
        color: var(--teal);
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .cons li::before {
        content: '– ';
        color: var(--gold-dark);
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 30px 20px 40px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #6b5c48;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .columns-container { flex-direction: column; }
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">Sumatra, Indonesia</p>
        <h1>Medan</h1>
        <p>A peek of the city</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <p class="intro">
            Medan is Indonesia's largest city outside Java — known for affordable living,
            street food, and a fast-paced urban rhythm. Here's a balanced look at what
            makes it appealing and what takes some getting used to.
        </p>

        <div class="columns-container">
            <div class="card pros">
                <h3>Pros</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Cheap, excellent street food</li>
                    <li>Affordable housing</li>
                    <li>Great online shopping and delivery culture</li>
                    <li>Lively, sociable neighborhoods</li>
                    <li>Stores and stalls within easy reach</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="card cons">
                <h3>Cons</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Theft and robbery risk</li>
                    <li>Heavy air pollution and traffic</li>
                    <li>High smoking rates in public spaces</li>
                    <li>Corruption in local institutions</li>
                    <li>Nobody has a driving license</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        Made by Daniel, Pls don't come after me Indonesia.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
